// F1 diagnostics — folded EXPECT_COMPILE_FAIL single-file fixtures (dobrado, dir removido)
// case: discard_param_plain_fn
//
// A STANDALONE case file, not a namespace of this project's folded build. Its diagnostic
// comes from a checker PRE-WALK pass, which stops at the FIRST error instead of collecting
// every one — so folding it into the shared build would mask all 37 diagnostics behind this
// one. It costs its own build until the pre-walk passes collect like the item walk does.
// expected diagnostic: 'a `_` discard parameter is only allowed when impleme'
/**
 * bad — a plain function that tries to declare a `_` discard parameter; the checker rejects it
 * because a plain function's author controls the signature and must name the parameter (owner
 * refinement 2026-07-15).
 *
 * @param x  the kept argument
 * @return   never — the checker rejects this signature
 */
pub fn bad(x: i64, _) -> i64 { x }

if bad(1, 2) != 1 { exit(1) }
